ma Stack management\n53\t  surfaces appear in the Dashboard with no manual opt-in.\n54\t- On a non-entitled cluster, Llama Stack management surfaces remain\n55\t  unavailable.\n56\t- The Tech Preview opt-in gate for Llama Stack management no longer exists in\n57\t  the configuration surface.\n58\t- An administrator can disable Llama Stack management via configuration, and\n59\t  the documented default can be reverted without code changes (feature-flag\n60\t  rollback for the default-on change).\n61\t\n62\t## HLR Traceability\n63\t\n64\t- HLR-5 (P1): the Dashboard enables Llama Stack management by default for\n65\t  entitled clusters (no TP opt-in gate).\n66\t\n67\t## Risks / Notes\n68\t\n69\t- The change alters default user-visible behavior; the rollback/feature-flag\n70\t  acceptance criterion above covers reverting the default.\n71\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-93cc13bea82195ae","agent_id":"a3c8344ca9bf30bea","session_id":"1137ef5d-6881-4563-aaa6-337da4612527","uuid":"50666aa0-dcdc-45b6-b43e-1a8e0f34b42d","timestamp":"2026-10-26T22:12:04.976Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-af1fe08100e90b43","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9014 decomposition"}
