ested\n53\t  upgrade path from the last two TP releases and any behavior changes.\n54\t- Documentation of the production support posture: SLO targets, backport\n55\t  policy, and the supported configuration matrix with documented scale\n56\t  limits.\n57\t- Documentation of the supported TrustyAI guardrails integration for GA\n58\t  distributions.\n59\t- Documentation of default Dashboard enablement for entitled clusters,\n60\t  including how administrators disable it.\n61\t\n62\t## Acceptance Criteria\n63\t\n64\t- Llama Stack documentation meets GA standards and covers the full GA feature\n65\t  set with no Tech Preview disclaimers on supported surfaces.\n66\t- Migration notes from Tech Preview are published, covering the upgrade path\n67\t  from the last two TP releases.\n68\t- All documentation is technically reviewed against the delivered\n69\t  implementations (review recorded per topic).\n70\t- The documentation set covers the supported guardrails integration, the\n71\t  support posture, and default Dashboard enablement.\n72\t\n73\t## HLR Traceability\n74\t\n75\t- HLR-6 (P2): documentation is uplifted to GA standards, including migration\n76\t  notes from TP.\n77\t\n78\t## Risks / Notes\n79\t\n80\t- Priority is derived from the strategy-level Critical rating per the\n81\t  docs-authoring priority exception, not from HLR-6's P2 label; the epic is\n82\t  structurally last regardless.\n83\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-93cc13bea82195ae","agent_id":"a3c8344ca9bf30bea","session_id":"1137ef5d-6881-4563-aaa6-337da4612527","uuid":"27684cf9-838d-49e3-bd2b-e737f7840e70","timestamp":"2026-10-26T22:12:05.679Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-af2575a403591bbe","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9014 decomposition"}
